            <div xml:id="d727-a5">

                <pb facs="0868" n="766" xml:id="pg766"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister O’Brien to
                        the Chairman of the Revolutionary
                    Committee.</hi></head>
                <p>The American minister, dean of the diplomatic corps, presents his compliments to
                    Mr. Adolfo Riquléme, and begs him to obtain a cessation for an hour, of
                    hostilities against the Government palace in order that Gen Ferreira may be
                    informed of the conditions, of the revolutionary committee, contained in their
                    note dated to-day.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Hotel Hispano Americano, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1908-07-03">July 3, 1908</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward C. O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
